<BaseLayout title="For Farmers | DFL Eggs"><Header /><main><section class="page-hero farmer-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">For farmers</p><h1>More confidence before your next <em>rearing cycle.</em></h1><p>DFL Eggs is designed for farmers who want a practical way to enquire, confirm availability and access DFLs through the relevant supply channel.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#enquiry">Enquire as a farmer <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap info-cards three"><article><Icons name="quality"/><h3>Quality-first approach</h3><p>A product and process designed around healthy starts for rearing.</p></article><article><Icons name="access"/><h3>Clearer access</h3><p>Ask about the product, quantities and local availability in one place.</p></article><article><Icons name="support"/><h3>Practical support</h3><p>Get product-specific handling guidance once your order is confirmed.</p></article></div></section><section class="section how"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Your next steps</p><ol class="steps"><li><b>01</b><h3>Share your requirement</h3><p>Tell us your location, rearing plan and quantity needed.</p></li><li><b>02</b><h3>Confirm availability</h3><p>The team advises the relevant supply details.</p></li><li><b>03</b><h3>Receive and review</h3><p>Follow the supplied product and handling guidance.</p></li><li><b>04</b><h3>Begin rearing</h3><p>Reach out locally if support is needed.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="section soft-panel"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2>Ordering works best when details are <em>clear early.</em></h2></div><div><p>Have your district, state, intended rearing period and estimated requirement ready before you enquire. This helps the team explain availability and the appropriate supply process more clearly.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#enquiry">Check availability <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></main><Footer /></BaseLayout>
